{
  "about": "Topic words for workplace news, shared by scripts/import_gdelt_news.py and server/news.mjs. 'query' words are sent to GDELT (and tag headlines); 'tagOnly' words only tag headlines (Malay and Chinese outlets, and wages). 'AI' alone is too short for the GDELT query, so it is tag-only. 'requires': a topic is kept only if the headline also has one of these words (otherwise it goes to the named topic), so 'AI' alone is AI industry news, not workplace news. 'exclude': a topic is dropped if the headline has one of these words (e.g. 'extremist recruitment' is not hiring). Rules agreed 23 Oct after reviewing the 21 Oct snapshot.",
  "query": {
    "AI and automation": [
      "artificial intelligence",
      "generative AI",
